              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Si no carga, enchufa el cable otra vez. If it isn't charging, plug the cable in again."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El enchufe is the plug or socket; in Spain it also means connections, knowing the right people."
